==Finnish==

===Denominal suffix===
'''-ton'''/'''-tön'''

#indicates lack of something (similar to [[-less]]) or [[in-]], [[im-]],[[il-]] and [[ir-]]

====Antonym====
*[[-llinen]]

====Examples====
*[[ajaton]] = timeless
*[[järjetön]] = meaningless
*[[mauton]] = tasteless
*[[näkymätön]] = invisible
*[[kuolematon]] = immortal
*[[ääretön]] = infinite

